You draw electical potential energy from your surroundings to replenish your Psi.

This deals [77, 104, 125, 142, 158 (TL1-5; MP 100; PSI 50%)] (max [116, 156, 187, 214, 237 (TL1-5; MP 100)]) Lightning damage to all targets around you within radius [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)], and has a [21%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 45% (TL1-5; PSI 50%)] (max [26%, 36%, 43%, 48%, 52% (TL1-5)]) chance to daze them for 3 turns.

You replenish [10, 13, 15, 18, 20 (TL1-5; PSI 50%)] (max [15, 20, 23, 27, 30 (TL1-5)]) Psi from the first target, with each additional target restoring 20% less than the one before it.

The strength of these effects increases as your Psi depletes and with your Mindpower.
